                                                "fields": {
                                                  "TEXT": ". List any container whose restarts grew since yesterday, any that is unhealthy, restarting or exited, any using over 85% of its memory limit, and how much of the machine's memory they use together (limit_mb is the machine's total for a container with no limit of its own). Then any errors in the log lines from about the last hour, by container, in a few words each. If all is well, say so in one line.\n\nContainers now:\n"
